Cannabis Consumer Poll — License & Notice

ABOUT THIS ARCHIVE
This repository is a personal, public archive of the Cannabis Consumer Poll, 
a public-opinion polling series I created and directed from 2023 to July 2026
as an independent contractor. It mirrors poll results I wrote, fielded, and
interpreted during that period.

